msgid "Fix:"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:190
msgid "Material Design Icons, and Simple Line Icons placed with 1.1.4 or earlier, no longer lose their stylesheet when Elementor serves the page from its element cache."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:191
msgid "Icons no longer lose their styles in a template, header, footer or loop item that was cached while shown next to another document using the same icon."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:192
msgid "The mox_icon_use_full_stylesheet filter now works for icon classes written outside Elementor's icon controls."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:193
#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:208
#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:209
#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:253
msgid "Update:"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:193
msgid "Material Design Icons now ships only its WOFF2 font, making the installed plugin about 1.9 MB smaller, and its picker no longer lists an invisible \"blank\" entry (7,447 icons)."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:194
#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:203
#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:204
msgid "Performance:"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:194
msgid "Icon library definitions are now built once per request instead of once for every icon rendered."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:203
msgid "Pages now load only the icon rules they use. A single icon used to pull in its library's entire stylesheet, up to about 4 MB. A page with five icons from four libraries now carries about 4 KB of icon CSS instead of about 12 MB."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:204
msgid "Bundled icon stylesheets are about 22% smaller, from 26.3 MB to 20.6 MB."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:205
msgid "Simple Line Icons is rebuilt from the Iconify icon set and rendered from SVG instead of a webfont. It used the unnamespaced \"icon\" and \"icon-*\" classes, which many themes and icon fonts also style, and a collision stopped the glyphs from appearing. All 189 icon names are unchanged and icons placed with earlier versions keep working."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:206
msgid "Icon manifests are now versioned, so a browser can no longer pair a fresh stylesheet with a cached older icon list."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:207
msgid "Uninstalling now removes plugin settings from every site of a multisite network."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:208
msgid "Settings page tabs are now keyboard and screen-reader accessible, work without JavaScript, and text colours meet WCAG AA contrast."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mox-icon-admin-display.php:209
msgid "Every bundled library now ships the full text of its license, including the ones that were missing a license file."
msgstr ""

